      "mergedPostDetails": "VRC App – No Results Showing\n\nDate: 16 September 2026\n\nTime: Approximately 21:23\n\nDevice: iPhone\n\nApp: VRC\n\nDescription of the issue\n\nWhen I open the VRC app and go to the Friends section, the “By Location” tab displays “No Results”.\n\nThe screen also shows the following tabs:\n\n* By Location\n\n* Online Friends\n\n* Offline Friends\n\n* Discord Friends\n\nHowever, no results are displayed under “By Location”.\n\nIssue\n\nI am unable to see any results in the By Location section. I would like to understand whether this is a technical issue, a server problem, or whether the feature is currently unavailable.\n\nRequest\n\nCould you please investigate this issue and advise me on how to resolve it?\n\nPlease let me know if you require any further information, screenshots, or details about my account.\n\nThank you.",
